for item in select jsonb_array_elements_text(E'["Sea cucumbers (Holothuroidea) — When threatened, some individuals expel internal organs, pulling off a masterclass in drastic interior-design restructuring. Because these creatures can regenerate the lost parts, they treat vital internal systems like disposable party favors.","Sea cucumbers (Holothuroidea) — Facing a predator, some of these echinoderms deploy an eviction notice on their own insides and expel internal organs. Since they can regenerate the lost parts, it is a biological DIY plumbing rebuild executed mid-crisis.","Sea cucumbers (Holothuroidea) — Threatened by foes, some members of this class forcefully expel internal organs as an extreme tactical exit strategy. They can regenerate the lost parts, proving that sometimes tossing your guts out is a valid life hack.","Sea cucumbers (Holothuroidea) — Some specimens respond to danger by choosing to expel internal organs into the water column. Since they can regenerate the lost parts, they practice a terrifyingly casual approach to emergency abdomen shedding."]'::jsonb) loop
